ampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "70c3e39", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "1216b41", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d7f6c0d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8e190f6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b165c68", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "00f3aff", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "67bf9b3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d665f80", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8b58b59", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b82fa47", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "daaf015", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "cb3ddaf", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2c4419e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f8928f9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "778b4aa", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3af9a22", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7fa4427", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6f34b63", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "83cc5dc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "ab73922", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0808c8d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "9d383d7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "705f7dc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2267460", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "d6d0f47", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": [